# Deployed scripts must stay LF-only regardless of the authoring OS/git
# config -- see TODO.md's "Deployment bugs found in production" section:
# a Windows-side commit with core.autocrlf=true previously reintroduced
# CRLF line endings into these files, breaking them on the Linux/Apache
# deployment target until manually fixed with `sed -i 's/\r$//'`.
html/**/*.py text eol=lf
apache/*.sh text eol=lf
